OL,3,GNEWSAOnly 28% of nurdles 'recovered',
OL,4,Aresearchers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnly 28% of nurdles which spilled into
OL,7,Fa river have been recovered and are
OL,8,Fexpected to continue washing up on
OL,9,Fbeaches in the future, scientists have
OL,10,Fcalculated.
OL,12,FAlmost 18 tonnes of plastic nurdles are
OL,13,Festimated to have spilled into the
OL,14,FRiver Tyne after a collision between
OL,15,Fships at the Port of Tyne in July.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39302
