OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1790870158
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOnly 28% of nurdles 'recovered',
OL,4,Aresearchers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, only 5.14 tonnes have been
OL,7,Frecovered despite volunteers spending
OL,8,Fthousands of hours clearing beaches
OL,9,Facross the region, work by Newcastle
OL,10,FUniversity and the Centre for
OL,11,FEnvironment, Fisheries and Aquaculture
OL,12,FScience (Cefas) found.
OL,14,FSouth Tyneside Council's director of
OL,15,Fcommunity operations Gary Kirsop, said
OL,16,Fthe multi-agency group in charge of the
OL,17,Fnurdle response "remained committed".
